  unitName: Mischievous Skalmold (EU)
  unitId: 710115
  unitNumber: 7022
  description: Part of the pantheon of fierce warriors coming from the coldest territories
    of Grand Gaia. Their legend tells us that 6 exceptional semi-goddesses select
    among the best of dying combatants, whom would be granted the right to enter
    their heaven and fight side by side with the gods. Skalmold is no longer worthy
    of her goddly title. Betrayer of her kind, slayer of her love, nobody knows how
    she has cheated her own death.
  summonDesc: 
  fusionDesc: The fire inside me is almost alive, always growing.
  evoDesc: Like a Phoenix, from death and fire i'm now reborn
